    "detailed_description": "<strong>100% free to play!</strong><br><br>Void Rifter is a dynamic, high speed mecha boomer shooter! Test your skills against other players in a high speed dynamic mech combat or hold your ground against waves of enemies and survive the horde.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Select from a range of tactical equipment to have an edge on your opponents;<br></li><li>Customize your mech using the in-game progression system, unlock more parts by playing more games (losing a match will still reward you with points, but winning will give you extra!); <br></li><li>Play on a flat screen (Available in beta) or in VR, supporting Pico Neo 3, Pico Neo 4, Oculus Quest 1 and 2, Oculus Rift (Available in beta), Valve Index (Available in beta), Vive (Available in beta), and more!</li></ul><br>A product brought to you by Piece by Piece XR Development.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>100% free to play!</strong><br><br>Void Rifter is a dynamic, high speed mecha boomer shooter! Test your skills against other players in a high speed dynamic mech combat or hold your ground against waves of enemies and survive the horde.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Select from a range of tactical equipment to have an edge on your opponents;<br></li><li>Customize your mech using the in-game progression system, unlock more parts by playing more games (losing a match will still reward you with points, but winning will give you extra!); <br></li><li>Play on a flat screen (Available in beta) or in VR, supporting Pico Neo 3, Pico Neo 4, Oculus Quest 1 and 2, Oculus Rift (Available in beta), Valve Index (Available in beta), Vive (Available in beta), and more!</li></ul><br>A product brought to you by Piece by Piece XR Development.",
